  "roof_interpretation": "The western roof narrows along the oblique street. Roof imagery resolves a continuous western group and the separately roofed eastern group in four acquisitions, with especially good independent optical traces in 2019 and 2021. The east gutter is visible only in sections beneath attachments. Multiplying its traced length by the scale gives a visible 9–10 m segment. Use the mapped 12.8 m only for the complete two-address frontage. The upper roof is displaced relative to the mapped wall; no individual unit or full roof is assigned to No. 3.",
